 "remarks": "Welcome to 56 Dry Hill Road, a charming and thoughtfully updated home centrally located to everything Norwalk has to offer. Featuring a flexible layout across three finished levels, this home provides plenty of space to live, work, and entertain. The Main Level features a bright Eat-In-Kitchen, inviting Living Room, Full Bath, and a versatile Bedroom or Dining Room with sliders leading directly to the back deck. Upstairs, two comfortably sized bedrooms give the home its classic Cape-style layout, while the fully finished Lower Level adds valuable living space with a Family Room or Playroom, additional Bedroom, Full Bath, and Laundry. Outside, enjoy a fully fenced backyard with plenty of room for entertaining, play, or simply relaxing outdoors. A detached one car garage with an adjoining screened in porch adds even more functionality and charm. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, schools, and major commuting routes 56 Dry Hill Road offers a flexible floor plan, generous indoor and outdoor living space, and a central Norwalk location. An exceptional combination of comfort, convenience, and versatility.",
